.TH "PACE PROFILE" "1" "2026-05-17" "0.1.0" "pace profile Manual"
.SH NAME
pace\-profile \- User profile information.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pace profile
[OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
User profile information.
.SH COMMANDS
.PP
\fBshow\fP
  Show user profile (name, profile number,...
  See \fBpace profile-show(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBshow\fP command.
.PP
\fBsettings\fP
  Show user profile settings.
  See \fBpace profile-settings(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBsettings\fP command.
.PP
\fBunit-system\fP
  Show the user's measurement unit system...
  See \fBpace profile-unit-system(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBunit-system\fP command.
